/arc-plc/texas/brooks-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Brooks County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids, July to August came in under 90% of normal in 44 of those years. In 2025, October to November came in at 34% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 186% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
